  "system": {
    "identifier": "fire-release-fox-fire",
    "description": "<p>A Flickering flame appears in your hand. The flame remains there for the duration and harms neither you or your equipment. The flame sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet. The jutsu ends if you dismiss it. You can also attack with the flame.</p>\n<p>As part of the Action used to cast this jutsu, you can make a ranged ninjutsu attack against a creature you can see within 30 feet of you. On a hit, the target begins to glow with a soft, warm, and glowing radiance. While glowing in this way, this jutsu’s duration becomes until the end of your next turn, and creatures have advantage on melee attacks targeting the creature.</p>",
